{
  "name": "@linkdesk/marketplace-kit",
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "description": "@linkdesk/marketplace-kit——LinkDesk 市场数据作者工具包（正典 11-作者模板与marketplace-kit.md）：marketplace.json / authors/<id>.json 的 schema、校验（validate，错误码与市场侧 warnings 同一套）、init 三形态骨架（L0/L1/L2）、作者 Ed25519 密钥对生成（keygen）与许可密钥签发（sign-license）。运行在作者机器 / CI，devDependency——⛔ 不并入 contracts（那是运行时面）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "schemas",
    "templates",
    "examples",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "sideEffects": false,
  "bin": {
    "marketplace-kit": "./dist/cli.js"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.0.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "prepublishOnly": "node ../../scripts/prepublish-auth-preflight.mjs --npm",
    "build": "node -e \"require('node:fs').rmSync('dist',{recursive:true,force:true})\" && tsc -p tsconfig.build.json",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "prepack": "npm run build"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "ajv": "^8.17.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "typescript": "^5.9.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "linkdesk",
    "marketplace",
    "plugin-store",
    "schema",
    "validation"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
